This repository holds two things: TargetFacade.dll, a macro-free facade over
Targetcore.dll's peer-to-peer messaging kernel, and TargetCom.dll (in com\),
an ATL in-proc COM server built on that facade. Targetcore and Msgcore are
separate repositories under the same licence and are NOT bundled here.


